Read `agent/tools/__init__.py`. Find the `_MODULES` list (or however modules are registered). Add `node_replacement` to it. Follow the existing pattern exactly.

Make sure `python -c "from agent.tools.node_replacement import TOOLS, handle; print(len(TOOLS))"` works.

